  :adr/body
  "# Decision\n\nThe hirameki implementation is canonical at `etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-hirameki`; its public-patent corpus is canonical at the independently versioned `etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-hirameki-patents`. Both retain flat west paths. Actor code consumes pinned multiformats-clj, kotoba-datom, and social-publication libraries and names the dataset by repository plus immutable revision.\n\nCanonical metadata is EDN. The corpus, datoms, publication manifest, and ingest provenance are each a single EDN form; the former JSON publication/provenance metadata is retired. The actor deterministically regenerates byte-identical corpus and datom artifacts matching the pinned data repository CIDs.\n\nThe numbered-root implementations had no remaining runtime path consumers and are replaced by `MOVED.edn` tombstones. ADR-2606212200 remains the domain and safety decision; this ADR amends its physical placement and persistence references."}]
